{"title":"Career Roadmap · Film Critic","role":"Film Critic","summary":"A Film Critic analyses films and communicates informed opinions about their artistic, technical, cultural and social significance.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Creative Writing / Film Studies / Screenwriting"},"about":[{"label":"Degree Alignment","text":"Excellent"},{"label":"Primary Sectors","text":"Journalism, Digital Media, Film Publications, Entertainment Media, Culture & Arts"},{"label":"Typical Entry Roles","text":"Film Review Writer, Entertainment Writer, Editorial Assistant, Content Writer, Film Researcher"},{"label":"Long-Term Roles","text":"Film Critic → Senior Critic → Film Editor → Arts/Culture Editor → Senior Film Journalist"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Film Critic analyses films and communicates informed opinions about their artistic, technical, cultural and social significance."},{"type":"p","text":"A professional film critic does much more than say whether a movie is \"good\" or \"bad.\" The role involves understanding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"Direction"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Sound design"},{"text":"Production design"},{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Film theory"},{"text":"Genre"},{"text":"Narrative structure"},{"text":"Cultural context"},{"text":"Representation"},{"text":"Audience reception"},{"text":"Film industry trends"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA specialising in Creative Writing / Film Studies / Screenwriting, this is a highly relevant career path."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Film criticism is largely a portfolio-driven career rather than a regulated profession. A degree helps develop analytical and writing ability, but published work, critical thinking, originality and credibility are usually more important than the degree title alone."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Film Critic Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core responsibilities"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Work"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film analysis"},{"text":"Analyse story, direction, acting and technical execution"}],[{"text":"Reviewing"},{"text":"Write film reviews and critical essays"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Study filmmakers, genres, movements and context"}],[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Interview directors, actors and filmmakers"}],[{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Cover film releases and industry developments"}],[{"text":"Cultural analysis"},{"text":"Examine social and cultural themes"}],[{"text":"Festival coverage"},{"text":"Cover film festivals and screenings"}],[{"text":"Editorial work"},{"text":"Edit and commission film-related content"}],[{"text":"Audience analysis"},{"text":"Understand reception and cultural impact"}],[{"text":"Multimedia"},{"text":"Create video/audio/podcast criticism"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Investigate film history and filmmaking practices"}]]}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"During BA"},{"text":"Film Blogger, Student Critic, Film Writer, Film Research Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Film Review Writer, Entertainment Writer, Editorial Assistant"}],[{"text":"1–4 years"},{"text":"Film Critic, Film Journalist, Entertainment Journalist"}],[{"text":"3–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Film Critic, Film Editor, Culture Writer"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Film Journalist, Arts/Culture Editor"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Film Editor, Culture Editor, Publications Lead, Independent Critic"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A person may also build an independent film criticism career through a publication, newsletter, YouTube channel, podcast or social platform."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Learn to Watch Films Critically"},{"type":"p","text":"The first objective is to move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I liked the movie.”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can explain why the film works or fails using evidence from its craft and context.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Film genres"},{"text":"Narrative theory"},{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"Basic film language"},{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Direction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn film vocabulary"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand terms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mise-en-scène"},{"text":"Shot composition"},{"text":"Framing"},{"text":"Camera movement"},{"text":"Blocking"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Diegetic/non-diegetic sound"},{"text":"Editing rhythm"},{"text":"Narrative structure"},{"text":"Character arc"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First project"},{"type":"p","text":"Watch 10 films from different genres and write:"},{"type":"h","text":"500–800 words per film"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What the director is attempting"},{"text":"How the film achieves it"},{"text":"Where it succeeds"},{"text":"Where it fails"},{"text":"Evidence from specific scenes"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Develop Critical Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Film criticism requires strong writing."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Argument construction"},{"text":"Critical analysis"},{"text":"Comparative analysis"},{"text":"Close reading"},{"text":"Evidence-based writing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Citation"},{"text":"Editorial style"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"SEO writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing exercises"},{"type":"p","text":"Write:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film reviews"},{"text":"Director profiles"},{"text":"Scene analyses"},{"text":"Genre essays"},{"text":"Actor performance analyses"},{"text":"Screenwriting critiques"},{"text":"Comparative film essays"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"The cinematography is beautiful.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Write:"},{"type":"p","text":"Explain how framing, lens choice, lighting, colour and camera movement contribute to the emotional meaning of the scene."},{"type":"p","text":"The second approach demonstrates actual critical ability."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Build a Film Criticism Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start publishing consistently."},{"type":"h","text":"Create a portfolio containing"},{"type":"h","text":"20–30 published film reviews"},{"type":"p","text":"plus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 deep-dive essays"},{"text":"3 director analyses"},{"text":"3 scene analyses"},{"text":"2 comparative essays"},{"text":"2 festival/event reports"},{"text":"2 interviews if possible"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Possible specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two areas."},{"type":"h","text":"Indian cinema"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Hindi"},{"text":"Bengali"},{"text":"Marathi"},{"text":"Independent cinema"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International cinema"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Korean"},{"text":"Japanese"},{"text":"European"},{"text":"American"},{"text":"Latin American"},{"text":"Iranian cinema"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Genre"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Horror"},{"text":"Science fiction"},{"text":"Documentary"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Crime"},{"text":"Thriller"},{"text":"Drama"},{"text":"Experimental cinema"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Become Professionally Visible","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the BA is four years, focus on developing a recognisable critical voice."},{"type":"h","text":"Build an independent platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible formats:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personal website"},{"text":"Film newsletter"},{"text":"YouTube channel"},{"text":"Podcast"},{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"X"},{"text":"Substack-style publication"},{"text":"Digital magazine"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to accumulate followers."},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Consistency","originality","critical depth","credibility."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Film language + history"},{"text":"10 analytical reviews"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Critical writing"},{"text":"15–20 published pieces"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Specialisation + portfolio"},{"text":"30+ strong pieces"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional identity"},{"text":"Portfolio + publication/festival experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film"},{"text":"Film history, theory, genres"}],[{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Close reading, narrative analysis"}],[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Reviews, essays, criticism"}],[{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"Story structure, screenplay analysis"}],[{"text":"Visual language"},{"text":"Cinematography, composition, lighting"}],[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Montage, pacing, continuity"}],[{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Music, dialogue, sound design"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Film history + cultural context"}],[{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Interviews, fact-checking, reporting"}],[{"text":"Digital"},{"text":"CMS, SEO, analytics"}],[{"text":"Multimedia"},{"text":"Video editing, audio/podcast"}],[{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Content distribution"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Research assistance + transcription + discovery"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Disclosure, fairness, copyright"}]]}]},{"heading":"Film Analysis Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional critic can analyse a film through multiple layers."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Story"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the central conflict?"},{"text":"Is the narrative coherent?"},{"text":"How are characters developed?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Screenplay"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Character arcs"},{"text":"Themes"},{"text":"Subtext"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Direction"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vision"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Performances"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Scene construction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Cinematography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Camera movement"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Lens choices"},{"text":"Visual motifs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Editing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Parallel editing"},{"text":"Continuity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Sound"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Score"},{"text":"Sound effects"},{"text":"Silence"},{"text":"Sound perspective"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Acting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Characterisation"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Physicality"},{"text":"Emotional credibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8. Production Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sets"},{"text":"Costumes"},{"text":"Props"},{"text":"Locations"},{"text":"Visual world-building"}]},{"type":"h","text":"9. Context"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical context"},{"text":"Social context"},{"text":"Cultural context"},{"text":"Political context"},{"text":"Industry context"}]},{"type":"h","text":"10. Overall meaning"},{"type":"p","text":"Finally:"},{"type":"p","text":"What is the film actually trying to say?"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are useful for developing journalism and publishing experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film magazines"},{"text":"Entertainment publications"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Digital media companies"},{"text":"Film websites"},{"text":"Production companies"},{"text":"Film festivals"},{"text":"Cultural publications"},{"text":"Arts organisations"},{"text":"Independent cinema publications"},{"text":"Entertainment portals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Writing Intern"},{"text":"Entertainment Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Film Research Intern"},{"text":"Content Writing Intern"},{"text":"Culture Writing Intern"},{"text":"Film Festival Intern"},{"text":"Media Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to produce during internships"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to leave with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Published articles"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Festival coverage"},{"text":"Research pieces"},{"text":"Editorial experience"}]}]},{"heading":"Film Festival Experience","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Film festivals can be particularly valuable."},{"type":"p","text":"Look for opportunities to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review festival films"},{"text":"Write festival reports"},{"text":"Interview filmmakers"},{"text":"Attend Q&A sessions"},{"text":"Research films"},{"text":"Assist festival publications"},{"text":"Create social content"},{"text":"Volunteer in media/press teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build relationships with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Critics"},{"text":"Journalists"},{"text":"Filmmakers"},{"text":"Festival programmers"},{"text":"Editors"},{"text":"Publicists"},{"text":"Researchers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional networking matters significantly in film journalism."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Formal certificates are not essential for becoming a film critic."},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise actual knowledge and published work."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film theory"},{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Creative writing"},{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Podcast production"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Digital publishing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technical tools can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WordPress"},{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Adobe Premiere Pro"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve"},{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Audacity"},{"text":"CMS platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Jobs After BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry opportunities"},{"type":"table","header":["Job Title","Alignment"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film Review Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Film Critic"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Film Research Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Culture Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Journalist"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Digital Content Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Film Festival Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Media Researcher"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Screenwriting Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Content Editor"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Video Essay Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Podcast Researcher"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Arts & Culture Writer"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build a Professional Film-Criticism Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain different types of writing."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Standard review"},{"type":"h","text":"800–1,200 words"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a newly released film."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Long-form criticism"},{"type":"h","text":"1,500–3,000 words"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Director's style"},{"text":"Theme"},{"text":"Cultural context"},{"text":"Film language"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Scene analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Take one scene and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Meaning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Comparative essay"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"How Two Directors Use Silence to Create Tension"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Director profile"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse the evolution of a filmmaker's style."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Film movement essay"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Italian Neorealism"},{"text":"French New Wave"},{"text":"New Hollywood"},{"text":"Indian Parallel Cinema"},{"text":"Iranian New Wave"}]}]},{"heading":"Film Criticism vs Film Journalism","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These should not be confused."},{"type":"table","header":["Film Criticism","Film Journalism"],"rows":[[{"text":"Analyses films"},{"text":"Reports film news"}],[{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Information"}],[{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Interviews"}],[{"text":"Film essays"},{"text":"Industry news"}],[{"text":"Theory/context"},{"text":"Production updates"}],[{"text":"Subjective but reasoned"},{"text":"Primarily factual"}],[{"text":"Long-form analysis"},{"text":"News/features"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong professional can do both."}]},{"heading":"Film Criticism + Creative Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The user's specialisation is especially useful because creative writing strengthens:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative understanding"},{"text":"Character analysis"},{"text":"Dialogue analysis"},{"text":"Story structure"},{"text":"Theme interpretation"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Voice"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Screenwriting adds another advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"A screenwriter understands:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Three-act structure"},{"text":"Scene construction"},{"text":"Character arcs"},{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Conflict"},{"text":"Pacing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This makes it easier to evaluate a screenplay critically."}]},{"heading":"Film Criticism + Data & Digital Media","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The traditional film critic can become a digital film analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Trends"},{"text":"YouTube analytics"},{"text":"Social-media analytics"},{"text":"Audience metrics"},{"text":"Box-office data"},{"text":"Streaming trends"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible projects:"},{"type":"h","text":"Box-office trend dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Genre popularity analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience rating vs critic rating analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"OTT content trend analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Film franchise performance analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a useful combination of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film expertise","journalism","data analysis."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Film Criticism","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will change film criticism, but it does not eliminate the need for critics."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can assist with"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film research"},{"text":"Filmography analysis"},{"text":"Transcript analysis"},{"text":"Subtitle comparison"},{"text":"Historical research"},{"text":"Interview transcription"},{"text":"Metadata analysis"},{"text":"Audience sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Box-office data analysis"},{"text":"Archive discovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"New opportunities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI & cinema criticism"},{"text":"Algorithmic recommendation analysis"},{"text":"Streaming-platform criticism"},{"text":"AI-generated film analysis"},{"text":"Representation analysis using large datasets"},{"text":"Film discovery systems"},{"text":"Digital humanities research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human value remains important"},{"type":"p","text":"A serious critic contributes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original interpretation"},{"text":"Cultural understanding"},{"text":"Taste"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Ethical judgement"},{"text":"Independent perspective"},{"text":"Argumentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated summaries are not substitutes for original criticism."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree can lead beyond traditional newspaper film criticism."},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Critic"},{"text":"Film Journalist"},{"text":"Entertainment Journalist"},{"text":"Culture Writer"},{"text":"Arts Editor"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Video Essayist"},{"text":"Film YouTuber"},{"text":"Film Podcast Host"},{"text":"Digital Film Editor"},{"text":"Film Newsletter Writer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Researcher"},{"text":"Film Historian"},{"text":"Cultural Researcher"},{"text":"Audience Research Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Script Reader"},{"text":"Development Assistant"},{"text":"Story Analyst"},{"text":"Film Festival Programmer Assistant"},{"text":"Content Acquisition Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Studies Researcher"},{"text":"Film Studies Lecturer/Academic pathway"},{"text":"Cultural Studies Researcher"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced academic careers normally require postgraduate study and, for academic research/teaching positions, potentially doctoral-level qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The same BA can lead to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative Writer"},{"text":"Screenwriter"},{"text":"Content Writer"},{"text":"Copywriter"},{"text":"Script Writer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reporter"},{"text":"Entertainment Journalist"},{"text":"Culture Journalist"},{"text":"Feature Writer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Film industry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Script Reader"},{"text":"Story Analyst"},{"text":"Production Assistant"},{"text":"Development Assistant"},{"text":"Film Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content Producer"},{"text":"Video Producer"},{"text":"Podcast Producer"},{"text":"Editorial Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Academia"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film Studies Researcher"},{"text":"Cultural Studies Researcher"},{"text":"Film Historian"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Traditional publication pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film Writing Intern","Editorial Assistant / Review Writer","Film Critic","Senior Film Critic","Film Editor","Arts & Culture Editor","Senior Editor / Publications Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Independent pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Film Writer","Film Blog/Newsletter","Audience Building","Film Publication/YouTube/Podcast","Independent Film Critic","Recognised Critic / Creator / Film Journalist"]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can critically analyse films across screenplay, direction, cinematography, editing, acting, sound and cultural context, and communicate that analysis through professional written and multimedia criticism.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Target profile"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film reviews"},{"text":"30+"}],[{"text":"Long-form essays"},{"text":"5–10"}],[{"text":"Scene analyses"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Director analyses"},{"text":"3+"}],[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"2–5"}],[{"text":"Festival experience"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Publication experience"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Film portfolio"},{"text":"Professional website/platform"}],[{"text":"Video essays"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Podcast/video"},{"text":"Optional but valuable"}],[{"text":"Film theory"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Digital publishing"},{"text":"Working proficiency"}],[{"text":"AI/media analytics"},{"text":"Basic–intermediate"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Creative Writing / Film Studies / Screenwriting"},{"type":"flow","items":["Study film history + theory + visual language","Learn screenwriting + narrative analysis + critical writing","Watch films systematically across Indian and international cinema","Write 30+ serious reviews and 5–10 long-form essays","Publish consistently through a portfolio website/publication/newsletter","Complete film journalism/editorial/festival internships","Learn SEO + CMS + video/audio production","Build a recognisable critical voice and specialisation","Apply for Film Review Writer / Entertainment Writer / Editorial Assistant / Film Researcher roles","Progress to Film Critic → Senior Critic → Film/Culture Editor","Optionally build an independent career through YouTube, podcast, newsletter or digital publication."]},{"type":"h","text":"Best 2030-ready combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film Studies","Critical Writing","Screenwriting","Film History","Journalism","Digital Publishing","Video/Podcast Production","Data/Streaming Analytics","AI-assisted Research."],"sep":"+"}]}]}